atrix(5.6692915 0 0 5.6692915 89.45763 2.66)\"/><path d=\"M1 0 Q0.99999994 0.41421354 0.70710677 0.70710677 Q0.41421354 0.99999994 0 1 Q-0.41421354 0.99999994 -0.70710677 0.70710677 Q-0.99999994 0.41421354 -1 0 Q-0.99999994 -0.41421354 -0.70710677 -0.70710677 Q-0.41421354 -0.99999994 0 -1 Q0.41421354 -0.99999994 0.70710677 -0.70710677 Q0.99999994 -0.41421354 1 0 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b22222\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"0.17638889\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" transform=\"matrix(5.6692915 0 0 5.6692915 89.45763 2.66)\"/></g></g></g></g></g></svg>\n more than tripled, while the French CAC <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"91\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 91 19\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"vl36-d\"><desc id=\"vl36-d\">A sparkline plot. It plots .v (vertical axis) against .i (horizontal axis). Based on 60 observations.</desc><defs></defs><g data-vellum-panel=\"plot\"><g data-vellum-panel=\"panel-area\"><g data-vellum-panel=\"panel-1-1\"><g data-vellum-pan=\"panel-1-1\"><g data-vellum-id=\"layer-1-sparkline-g1\"><path d=\"M0 15.946412 L1.5423728 15.692742 L3.0847456 15.392611 L4.6271186 15.493545 L6.1694913 16.34 L7.7118645 15.477524 L9.254237 15.16511 L10.79661 14.482605 L12.338983 15.220116 L13.881356 16.043074 L15.423729 15.408098 L16.966103 16.068707 L18.508474 15.964035 L20.050848 15.908495 L21.59322 14.681268 L23.135593 15.029463 L24.677965 15.482329 L26.220339 14.901827 L27.762712 13.708245 L29.305084 13.989151 L30.847458 14.095959 L32.38983 13.227608 L33.932205 13.620662 L35.474575 13.9571085 L37.01695 14.021193 L38.559322 15.156031 L40.101696 14.726128 L41.64407 15.394747 L43.18644 14.9990225 L44.728813 15.367511 L46.271187 15.533598 L47.81356 15.521315 L49.35593 14.713844 L50.898304 15.254294 L52.440678 14.974991 L53.98305 15.513304 L55.525425 15.629725 L57.067795 15.74668 L58.61017 14.620921 L60.152542 14.999557 L61.694916 14.034544 L63.23729 13.999831 L64.77966 14.868182 L66.32